 "new_module_rule": "A module not listed here is UNCLASSIFIED and the checker refuses a verdict. The rung that adds a module must add it here in its own prereg: SM-INPUT if it only states hand-entered SM data (charges, representations, ACC, beta coefficients, generation counts, CKM/KM, gauge-group data, breaking patterns) or imports only SM-INPUT modules for that purpose; GEOMETRY (PG or AMP) if it defines geometric or amplitude objects and states no SM data; MIXED/TEST otherwise (bundles, tests, constructions that use both), with an explicit default def-role and overrides for every def whose role differs.",
 "witness_exclusions": {
  "PositiveGeometryEmergentSpaceTime.BR5p.br5p_gauge_witness_nontrivial": "satisfiability witness: the SM-like coupling values (a = lam3 = lam4 = 1) are typed into the statement by hand; it exhibits a point, it derives nothing"
 },
 "auto_generated_suffixes": [
  "inj",
  "injEq",
  "sizeOf_spec",
  "ext",
  "ext_iff",
  "eta"
 ],
 "v2_rules": {
  "D1": "a non-Prop binder whose type uses the parent structure of an SM-var constant (e.g. x : BR5p.Inv) is an SM variable; field reads x.a, x.lam3 on such a bound x are SM data universally quantified, unconstrained unless a hypothesis references x",
  "D2": "a theorem named P.<s> with s in auto_generated_suffixes and P a constructor or inductive in the export is AUTO-GENERATED (kept in the denominator, never DERIVED)",
  "D3": "an override key k matches a declaration named k, k.<anything> or k_<anything>"
 },
